   180	> test, then submit_patch before the cap. The agent probably can't see wall-clock time from inside a declarative ADK bundle, so the
   181	> budget is stated in LLM-call/tool-call counts derived from the measured calls-per-minute at the target cap (v5: ~9-16 LLM calls
